{"labs": [{"id": 0, "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "frn2le02ob07re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Jean</span> : Salut Pierre. Comment tu vas aujourd'hui ?<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> : Salut Jean. Super bien.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "frn2le02ob07re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Jean </span> :     Alors qu'est-ce que tu fais durant ton temps libre Pierre ?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> :      Je fais du sport : du foot, du rugby, du tennis...", "id": 2, "time": "5500", "image": "frn2le02ob07re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Jean </span> :     M\u00eame en hiver ?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> :      Oh oui ! G\u00e9n\u00e9ralement je fais du foot d'int\u00e9rieur en hiver. Parfois je fais du rugby aussi. Et toi&nbsp;?", "id": 3, "time": "12000", "image": "frn2le02ob07re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Jean</span> : Je ne suis pas trop sport. On est tr\u00e8s diff\u00e9rents pour \u00e7a. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> : Diff\u00e9rent ?", "id": 4, "time": "21000", "image": "frn2le02ob07re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Jean</span>    : Je pr\u00e9f\u00e8re \u00eatre au calme. J'aime regarder la t\u00e9l\u00e9vision, lire des livres. J'\u00e9coute de la musique quand je conduis, donc, je ne prends jamais le bus. Enfin, c'est rare que je le prenne.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> :    Je vois ce que tu veux dire.", "id": 5, "time": "25000", "image": "frn2le02ob07re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Jean </span> :    Je regarde toujours les infos le matin.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> :     Je lis souvent le journal mais je ne regarde jamais les infos.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Jean </span> :      On aime les m\u00eames choses mais on est tr\u00e8s diff\u00e9rents !\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span> : C'est vrai.", "id": 6, "time": "37500", "image": "frn2le02ob07re2img05.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "frn2le02ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "frn2le02ob07re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "type": "WLC", "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Je peux dire \u00e0 quelle fr\u00e9quence je fais quelque chose.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux parler de mes loisirs.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Est-ce que vous avez des loisirs ?  ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Quelles activit\u00e9s pratiquez-vous dans votre temps libre ? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Je peux partager de l'information personnelle. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Demandez \u00e0 votre camarade :", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Pierre et Jean parlent de leurs loisirs. Qu'est-ce qu'ils aiment faire ? D\u00e9couvrons-le ! ", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "stimuli_ids": [1], "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "selected": 0, "correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"id": 1, "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}]